// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1802099841" "Nice job clearing the Arachnoids out of that research lab. Arachnos definitely wants to get their kidnapped Executioner back, so it looks like we got another job. We can spend days scouring all the tunnels, but fortunately Arachnos has taken steps in case somethin' like this happens! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to talk with Regent Korol about tracking down Executioner Garrod.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1976801422" "Speak with Regent Korol"
// SendOffString :
"P542245375" "Korol's kinda creepy, but keeps track of all that goes on in Grandville. She'll know what to do."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4294136686" "You talk with Korol yet? Get goin'!"

