// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2532922870" "<shout>SKREEEEE! {VillainName} must die!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1376924907" "I sensed your approach, {VillainName}! I take it you are here in the matter of the missing Bane Spider? Yes, Arachnos has many ways of keeping track of our assets. Executioner Garrod was implanted with a homing beacon, a little trick we picked up from Crey Industries. Take this tracking device - it should show you exactly where you need to go.<br><br>Take care, my pet. Don't let the Arachnoids bite!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1113905058" "Regent Korol hooked you up with a tracking device, eh? Good stuff! That's gonna save us a bunch of time huntin' this guy down!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1703644942" "You still got the tracking device from Regent Korol? Good, good! Let's finish up this job! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head into the Arachnoid tunnels and get Executioner Garrod!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1820733655" "Rescue Garrod from Arachnoids"
// SendOffString :
"P3844732734" "Arachnos says the Arachnoids nabbed a whole Bane Spider unit, but only Garrod is the important one to rescue. Get him out there - if those critters didn't eat him already!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P113801488" "What, you waitin' for those critters to eat Executioner Garrod or somethin'?  Move it!"

